WEBVTT

00:33:58.496 --> 00:34:01.829
And I'm like, Cheryl Strayed is
the realest name I ever had.

00:34:02.454 --> 00:34:05.621
So you talked about your hike along
the Pacific Crest Trail.

00:34:05.621 --> 00:34:09.454
You were 26 when you embarked
on this solo three month,

00:34:09.496 --> 00:34:11.371
eleven hundred mile hike.

00:34:11.954 --> 00:34:17.079
If you knew that there were people
listening who are considering taking

00:34:17.079 --> 00:34:20.496
the same hike, what would you share with
them? What would you tell them?

00:34:20.496 --> 00:34:22.038
What advice might you give them?

00:34:22.829 --> 00:34:24.913
Well, absolutely go if you have any,

00:34:24.996 --> 00:34:28.371
whether it's the same hike
as mine or any long hike.

00:34:28.371 --> 00:34:35.371
If you have any desire to do this,
do it because it is walking,